Aicsemi SDIO firmware, copied without binary changes from:
https://github.com/radxa-pkg/aic8800
revision 75fd5545a3e7a8ec2c2b022f0088cc352ad2b623
src/SDIO/driver_fw/fw/{aic8800,aic8800DC,aic8800D80}

post-wifibt.sh installs files from all three subdirectories into
/lib/firmware/aic8800. Filenames are distinct. The driver selects firmware
based on the chip ID and silicon revision. Some early revisions need
additional firmware not included in this vendor release.
See UPSTREAM-COPYRIGHT for the original repository packaging notice.
